<%- include('_partials/head') %>
<%- include('_partials/nav') %>

<main>
    <section class="section pricing-hero-section">
        <div class="container text-center">
            <h1 class="pricing-title">Simple, Transparent Pricing</h1>
            <p class="pricing-subtitle">
                One subscription unlocks everything. No hidden costs. Tell Kurukoo what you need or what you can do.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section container">
        <div class="grid grid-3 pricing-grid">
            <div class="card pricing-card base-pricing-card pricing-card-base">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="pricing-card-title">Base</h3>
                    <div class="price"><%= t.currency %><%= t.pricing.base %><span>/mo</span></div>
                    <ul class="features-list">
                        <li>✓ 30 Daily Points included</li>
                        <li>✓ Full access to living chat & memory</li>
                        <li>✓ Default Nearby Radar discovery</li>
                        <li>✓ Access to all 45 service verticals</li>
                        <li>✓ Web App (PWA) — 100% Free daily access</li>
                        <li>⚠ WhatsApp &amp; USSD (deducts 1 Point/session to cover carrier/Meta fees)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <a href="https://wa.me/2347000" class="btn w-full font-bold mt-24">Start on Base</a>
            </div>
            
            <div class="card pricing-card featured featured-pricing-card pricing-card-base">
                <div>
                    <span class="pricing-badge">RECOMMENDED</span>
                    <h3 class="pricing-card-title">Plus</h3>
                    <div class="price"><%= t.currency %><%= t.pricing.plus %><span>/mo</span></div>
                    <ul class="features-list">
                        <li>✓ 60 Daily Points included</li>
                        <li>✓ Priority Provider Matching</li>
                        <li>✓ Default Nearby Radar discovery</li>
                        <li>✓ 1 Free Listing Boost per month</li>
                        <li>✓ SMS Fallback Notifications</li>
                        <li>✓ Proactive Opportunity Nudges</li>
                        <li>✓ **Zero-fee WhatsApp &amp; USSD access** (fees fully covered)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <a href="https://wa.me/2347000" class="btn btn-primary w-full font-bold mt-24">Choose Plus</a>
            </div>
            
            <div class="card pricing-card base-pricing-card pricing-card-base">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="pricing-card-title">Business</h3>
                    <div class="price"><%= t.currency %><%= t.pricing.business %><span>/mo</span></div>
                    <ul class="features-list">
                        <li>✓ 120 Daily Points included</li>
                        <li>✓ Verified Business Storefront</li>
                        <li>✓ Sales & Lead Analytics</li>
                        <li>✓ 10 Free Listing Boosts per month</li>
                        <li>✓ Priority Search Placement</li>
                        <li>✓ Bulk Product Catalogue Import</li>
                        <li>✓ **Zero-fee WhatsApp &amp; USSD access** (fees fully covered)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <a href="https://wa.me/2347000" class="btn w-full font-bold mt-24">Choose Business</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section container pricing-faq-section">
        <h2 class="text-center mb-12">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <div class="flex-col gap-8 pricing-faq-wrapper">
            <div>
                <h4 class="pricing-faq-title">What are Points?</h4>
                <p class="pricing-faq-text">Points are Kurukoo's internal loyalty tokens. They are used to request services, boost your visibility, or unlock provider leads. You earn Points through daily engagement, completed jobs, and referrals.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4 class="pricing-faq-title">How does Kurukoo learn my routine?</h4>
                <p class="pricing-faq-text">There are no complex forms to fill. Every chat updates your single private living memory profile dynamically. Over time, Kurukoo remembers your usual services, preferred locations, and skills.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4 class="pricing-faq-title">Why do WhatsApp and USSD deduct Points on the Base tier?</h4>
                <p class="pricing-faq-text">Meta charges a standard commercial session fee of ₦9.28 for each 24-hour conversation window on WhatsApp Business, and telecom carriers levy session charges on USSD shortcodes (*7000#). To keep Kurukoo sustainable, we deduct 1 Point per daily active session on the Base tier to offset these costs. On our **Plus** and **Business** tiers, these costs are 100% absorbed by your subscription.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4 class="pricing-faq-title">Is the Web App (PWA) free to use?</h4>
                <p class="pricing-faq-text">Yes! The **Kurukoo Progressive Web App (PWA)** is completely free of any messaging session fees. It is the highly recommended and most interactive channel for smart devices, offering detailed maps, instant messaging, and state caching without incurring any WhatsApp or USSD carrier billing overheads.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>

<%- include('_partials/footer') %>
